    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA fabulous property beautifully positioned at the end of the Dakota Court development facing well-maintained common garden in a tranquil waterside setting.  \n\nDNG are delighted to present to the market number 1 Dakota Court. This stunning spacious light-filled 2 bed 2 bath duplex apartment which offers some exceptional features including a spacious living/dining room with access to a balcony .The development boasts landscaped grounds and a south facing courtyard.There asecure underground parking.\n\n\nPresented in excellent condition number 1 Dakota Court offers 2 double bedrooms one of which is en-suite.There is excellent storage throughout. This property has assigned  underground parking.\n\nThe accommodation includes an entrance hallway with access to a storage area, an extremely spacious living/dining area and separate kitchen ,2 double bedrooms one of which is en-suite and a family bathroom.This property will impress buyers looking to acquire an exceptional duplex in a much sought after and private development: Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nThe location is all that one could wish for, a short stroll will bring you to the National Botanic Gardens, all the amenities that Phibsboro village has to offer with local restaurants and cafes are nearby and the area is also well served by excellent public transport links.Including the Luas and Q.B.C. The apartment is in an ideal location for access to the four Dublin universities.Located within walking distance of three teaching hospitals (Rotunda, Mater, CHI Temple Street).\n\n\nService charge.The annual fee including car park is 2556 Dakota management company.\n\nViewing by appointment with DNG estate agents in Phibsboro 01 8300989. Please contact DNG on 01 8300989 Local Agents Brian McGee MIPAV, Ciarán Jones MIPAV, Michelle Keeley and Vincent Mullen."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.76m x 1.338m\nEntrance hall is spacious and bright with laminate floor.There is access to a cloak room for additional storage.\n\nGuest Water Closet - 1.5m x 1.59m\nGuest W/C with tiled floor .There is a W/C and a W.H.B.\n\nLiving/dining area - 4m x 7.7m\nLiving/dining area with excellent light and space faces front garden area.\n\nKitchen - 2.75m X2.1m\nKitchen with floor and wall presses there is a tiled floor.\n\nLanding - \nLanding area with good light, there is a hotpress for additional storages.\n\nBathroom - 1.83m x 1.94m\nFamily bathroom with tiled floor, there is a bath with shower over.There is a W/C and a W.H.B.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.8m x 2.75m\nDouble bedroom en-suite with built-in storage.Located at the front of the property.\n\nEn-suite - 1.02m x 1.62m\nEn-suite with W/C, W.H.B and shower there is a tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 2.6m\nBedroom located at the front of the house.There is carpet flooring and built-in storage.\n\nOutside - \nThere is access to the common area which is well maintained inside this secure development.There is an underground car park space.\n\n"
      },
